ANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162270530,"discussion_id":"79f34ae45aa863d0cdbcf3851b50087e199ef116","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-05T09:09:24+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-05T09:09:24+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162270607,"discussion_id":"92435f1b1305cb333503cb326599680017788346","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复了SIMD排序分片算法中`ubIndexFactor_`（UB索引因子）计算逻辑的潜在缺陷。原计算方式在特定条件下（如`halfUbSize`恰好能被整除时）可能导致初始因子值偏小，使得后续的`while`循环提前退出，无法充分利用UB空间，从而影响算子性能。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在`DoOpTilingSplitAfterSort`和`DoOpTilingSplitPreSort`两个函数中，调整了`ubIndexFactor_`的初始化策略。具体修改为：在通过`halfUbSize`除以所需内存大小得到初始值后，先将其`加1`，再进入递减循环寻找满足UB空间约束的最大可行值。这种“先加后减”的策略确保了初始试探值是一个上界，从而能够更充分地探索UB空间的利用潜力，优化数据分片和循环次数。","created_at":"2026-02-05T09:10:24+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-05T09:10:24+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162273145,"discussion_id":"521af9e6d8fd71ac00ec186edf929e0a8a584177","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-02-05T09:30:15+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-05T09:30:15+08:00","user":{"id":"68abc1ea0f820658f05c100a","login":"jinpenghe","object_id":"68abc1ea0f820658f05c100a","name":"jinpenghe","avatar_url":"https: